<h2 class="doc_title">M/S Urmila Oil Industries vs U.P. Dakshiranchal Vidut Vitran Nigam ... on 7 November, 2019</h2>

<h3 class="doc_bench">Bench: <a href="/search/?formInput=benchid:s-agarwal">Sudhir Agarwal</a>, <a href="/search/?formInput=benchid:r-misra">Rajeev Misra</a></h3>

